<title>UK: Wuerttemberg Hypo adds 700 mln marks to 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemberg Hypo adds 700 mln marks to 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.7 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, Hypobank and Trinkaus and Burkhardt said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTMBERG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.7 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    11.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	  SELL CONC  17 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
